From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 22:31:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 25/54] Add a post-game nature and ability coach
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

An NPC in the Indigo Plateau Pokémon Center changes a party Pokémon's
nature (choose the stat to raise and lower) or swaps it to its other
ability. The new personality keeps gender, shininess, Unown's letter and
Wurmple's branch; stats are recalculated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
